  "title": "Dry Spice Rub for Lamb or Beef",
  "description": "A blend of paprika, dried thyme and basil, cumin, and curry powder, if you choose, makes a flavorful dry rub to season grilled or roasted lamb and beef.",
  "authors": [
    "Jessica Godfrey"
  ],
